DecompressionStream: when a chunk decodes and then hits input after the end
of the compressed data, error the stream right after enqueuing its output
(op_compression_check, runtime/core.js), not at the next write or at close,
which may never come (compression/decompression-extra-input.any.js; Deno
has the same bug).

